    <briefdescription>
<para><ref refid="classhmap_1_1Array" kindref="compound">Array</ref> (x, y) function class. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class functions like an image sampler with normalized coordinates found on a GPU. It is based on a 2D array, allowing interpolation of any value at a given (x, y) coordinate. Specific boundary conditions, such as periodicity, can also be used. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
